 "_about": "Parts change stats on their own ('mods': fractions added to the stat multiplier; a part's maker strengthens its focus stats, data/manufacturers.json part_boost). 'combos' = what certain parts do TOGETHER on one gun (core/gun_combos.gd): 'needs' lists slot -> kind, 'mods' are extra stat changes, 'buffs' give a buff effect of data/gun_loot.json at that value (added to a rolled buff of the same kind), 'name' is put into the gun's name. 'matched' = bonus when that many parts come from the gun's own manufacturer. All numbers are placeholders to tune. 'view' on a part: how it is shown on the gun model (game/gun_parts_view.gd): 'model' file in assets/models/weapons/parts/, or 'barrel_scale' [thickness, length] for barrels. A body's 'part_scale' sizes attached parts. move_speed in a part's mods shifts the carrying speed of the gun (-0.04 = 4 % slower); all parts together never change it by more than -15 % / +8 %.",
